2. Google Fonts

  This software does not bundle any font files. Fonts are loaded at runtime
  from Google Fonts (https://fonts.google.com/) in the user's browser.

  Fonts used by default:

  - Noto Serif JP — SIL Open Font License, 1.1
    https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Noto+Serif+JP
  - Noto Sans JP — SIL Open Font License, 1.1
    https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Noto+Sans+JP

  Other fonts:

  Users can specify any other font available on Google Fonts by editing the
  JSON settings. Such fonts are loaded from Google Fonts at the user's own
  choice and are subject to their respective licenses (SIL Open Font License
  or Apache License, as specified by each font). Please check the license of
  each font on its Google Fonts page.

  The generic families "serif" and "sans-serif" use fonts installed on the
  user's own device; nothing is loaded or distributed for them.
